OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine dry day for most with
OL,6,Fbest of bright and sunny spells across
OL,7,FDumfries and Galloway. Cloud
OL,8,Fincreasing in the east for the
OL,9,Fafternoon, bringing the chance of a
OL,10,Ffew scattered light showers here for
OL,11,Flate afternoon. Winds light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud and scattered light
OL,14,Fshowers in Lothian and Borders.
OL,15,FDumfries and Galloway dry with clear
OL,16,Fspells bringing the risk of rural
OL,17,Ffrost and fog patches come dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
