OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEast keeping cloudy skies and
OL,6,Fsome scattered drizzly showers. West
OL,7,Fdry with bright and sunny spells,
OL,8,Ftowards the west coast. Winds light
OL,9,Fmainly from the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FEast
OL,12,Fcloudy with some patchy light rain and
OL,13,Fdrizzle, always focused around the
OL,14,Fcoast and most persistent on Thursday.
OL,15,FWest dry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
